@andyrozman 
Not sure if I understand "theme". I have only the "skin" option (at least on the builds I have seen). I think that is mostly about screen resolution? Or are you saying an additional skin could be created for different coloring? That would be perfect!

(Btw: maybe it is also a matter of personal taste, but the grey-isch color reminds me to some cheapo phones screens that bleed causing black not being pure black)

@vanelsberg 
I be with you, I changed the background colors to black on my own in code.
Hate this gray background on my last phone (Samsung) and now also on my Pixel 5.
It looks so mutch better in dark black.

